{"nodes": [{"id": "ai_dualdm_test_phase_separation", "label": "Referee content never reaches onDelta; only narrator prose does", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L147-L216", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The two-phase contract: referee runs the agentic tool loop and its beat sheet is internal; narrator is a second, tools-free completion whose stream is what the player reads. onToolUse still fires for referee tool calls so the dice UI works."}, {"id": "ai_dualdm_test_narrator_request_is_tools_free", "label": "Narrator request carries no tools/tool_choice and uses narratorModel", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L205-L215", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Keeps mechanics strictly on the referee model; the narrator cannot mutate state even if it tries."}, {"id": "ai_dualdm_test_zero_tool_nudge", "label": "Referee is nudged exactly once when a turn resolved no tools", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L218-L320", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Live 'I drink a tincture to heal' turn: the referee wrote a beat sheet and called nothing, so HP/inventory never moved while the narrator described the heal as having happened. One nudge, then it accepts a genuinely mechanics-free turn -- and the narrator is told 'resolved NOTHING mechanical this turn' so it cannot invent one."}, {"id": "ai_dualdm_test_missing_defeat_foe_nudge", "label": "Missing defeat_foe / apply_damage nudge keys off mechanics, not prose", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L482-L714", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Live failure: the referee rolled the kill, wrote 'dead before he hits the ground', called nothing -- 0 XP and no foe record. Prompting did not fix it, so the code checks what the prompt cannot. The first attempt keyed off beat-sheet wording and missed 'collapses lifelessly'; it now fires on a landed attack regardless of phrasing, stays quiet on a miss or when damage already landed, does not read the hero going down as a victory, and nudges at most once per turn."}, {"id": "ai_dualdm_test_interactive_roll_pauses_turn", "label": "roller:'player' pauses the dual turn before the narrator phase", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L322-L379", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Neither the referee's follow-up step nor the narrator may run until the player's roll resolves, or the prose would describe an outcome the player has not rolled yet."}, {"id": "ai_dualdm_test_error_classification", "label": "Referee-phase and narrator-phase HTTP failures both surface as DmError", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L381-L417", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A 401 in the referee phase must classify as 'auth' and never reach the narrator; a narrator-phase 503 must still end the turn with busy cleared rather than hanging."}, {"id": "ai_dualdm_test_interrupt_is_silent", "label": "interrupt() aborts in flight without onError/onTurnComplete", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L419-L446,L794-L817", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A deliberate abort is not a failure: it must clear busy, fire no callbacks, and must not be reported as a provider stall."}, {"id": "ai_dualdm_test_narrator_model_fallback", "label": "Narrator falls back to openai.model with a friendly system note", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L448-L476", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "An unset narratorModel degrades to the referee's model rather than erroring, and says so once at start()."}, {"id": "ai_dualdm_test_empty_narration_retry", "label": "Empty narration retried within a budget, then given up honestly", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L720-L766", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Free-tier providers intermittently return a stream with no content, which killed the turn outright. Initial + NARRATOR_EMPTY_RETRIES attempts, then a 'returned nothing' error rather than a loop."}, {"id": "ai_dualdm_test_stall_timeout", "label": "A stream that opens and goes silent is broken by a stall timeout", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L768-L792", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Live: a provider opened a stream and never sent a byte, leaving the game 'thinking' for five minutes with only STOP as a way out. The error names which phase (referee) went quiet and clears busy."}, {"id": "ai_dualdm_test_narrator_ground_truth", "label": "Narrator prompt carries the hero's real post-turn numbers", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L837-L981", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Regression: the narrator wrote 'your HP climbs to eleven of thirteen' and described a tincture being drained on a turn where no tool ran, so the prose and the character sheet disagreed and the prose won in the player's head. The prompt now embeds HP x/y, the Carrying list, a GROUND TRUTH block, and an explicit 'has NOT taken effect' warning when no tools ran; it also strips the referee-only <system-reminder> out of the player text and forbids suggesting uncarried items."}, {"id": "ai_dualdm_test_describecondition", "label": "describeCondition states CONSCIOUS/DOWN outright, never inferable", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L916-L951", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Live defect: handed a bare 'HP 5/12' the narrator wrote a death scene on a turn where the attack MISSED. Any hp>0 reads CONSCIOUS and forbids collapse; only hp<=0 reads DOWN and permits death; wording scales unhurt/lightly hurt/wounded/badly wounded; maxHp 0 must not divide by zero."}, {"id": "ai_dualdm_test_formattooloutcomes", "label": "Tool outcomes render one line each, failures marked distinctly", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L821-L835", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The narrator needs to see a FAILED call as a failure, not as something that happened; an empty turn reads '(no tool calls this turn)'."}, {"id": "ai_dualdm_referee_narrator_split", "label": "Referee resolves mechanics, narrator writes prose from ground truth", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L1-L8", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The architectural bet of the dual backend: a reliable tool-caller owns state, a permissive prose model owns voice, and everything the narrator is allowed to say is derived from what the referee actually did. Every dualDm invariant is a consequence of enforcing that split against weak free-tier models."}], "edges": [{"source": "ai_dualdm_test_phase_separation", "target": "ai_dualdm_dualmodeldmsession", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_narrator_request_is_tools_free", "target": "ai_dualdm_dualmodeldmsession", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_zero_tool_nudge", "target": "ai_dualdm_dualmodeldmsession", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_missing_defeat_foe_nudge", "target": "ai_dualdm_dualmodeldmsession", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_missing_defeat_foe_nudge", "target": "ai_tools_createdmtools", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L17", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_missing_defeat_foe_nudge", "target": "game_engine_engine", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L14", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_interactive_roll_pauses_turn", "target": "ai_dualdm_dualmodeldmsession", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_interactive_roll_pauses_turn", "target": "ai_tools_createdmtools", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L103", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_error_classification", "target": "ai_dualdm_dualmodeldmsession", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_interrupt_is_silent", "target": "ai_dualdm_dualmodeldmsession", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_narrator_model_fallback", "target": "game_settings_loadsettings", "relation": "references", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L84-L99", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_empty_narration_retry", "target": "ai_dualdm_dualmodeldmsession", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_stall_timeout", "target": "ai_dualdm_dualmodeldmsession", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L19", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_narrator_ground_truth", "target": "ai_dualdm_buildnarratoruserprompt", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L21", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_narrator_ground_truth", "target": "ai_dualdm_formatherogroundtruth", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L23", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_describecondition", "target": "ai_dualdm_describecondition", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L22", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_formatherogroundtruth", "target": "ai_dualdm_describecondition", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L968-L972", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_buildnarratoruserprompt", "target": "ai_dualdm_formatherogroundtruth", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L880-L890", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_buildnarratoruserprompt", "target": "ai_dualdm_formattooloutcomes", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L858-L865", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_formattooloutcomes", "target": "ai_dualdm_formattooloutcomes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L20", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_referee_narrator_split", "target": "ai_dualdm_dualmodeldmsession", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L1-L8", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_referee_narrator_split", "target": "ai_dualdm_test_phase_separation", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L1-L8", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_referee_narrator_split", "target": "ai_dualdm_test_narrator_ground_truth", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L867-L871", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_dualmodeldmsession", "target": "ai_openaidm_openaidmsession", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L5-L6", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_dualmodeldmsession", "target": "ai_openaistream_stepaccumulator", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L27", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_interactive_roll_pauses_turn", "target": "ai_openaidm_test_interactive_roll_pauses_loop", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.95, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L322-L379", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_error_classification", "target": "ai_openaidm_test_auth_error_classification", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L381-L396", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_interrupt_is_silent", "target": "ai_openaidm_test_interrupt_no_retry", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L419-L446", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_narrator_ground_truth", "target": "ai_prompts_test_hero_sheet_modifiers", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L880-L890", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "ai_dualdm_test_empty_narration_retry", "target": "ai_openaihttp_test_retry_policy", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts", "source_location": "L747-L766", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "mechanical_honesty_stack", "label": "Keeping a weak referee/narrator pair mechanically honest", "nodes": ["ai_prompts_test_mechanics_guardrails", "ai_dualdm_test_zero_tool_nudge", "ai_dualdm_test_missing_defeat_foe_nudge", "ai_dualdm_test_narrator_ground_truth", "ai_tools_test_defeat_foe_single_call"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "test/ai/dualDm.test.ts"}]}